<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in moderately heavy trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average up 40.62 to 6010.00, a new high.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.34 to 374.23.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.14.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1209 to 1061.</p>
<p>Volume was 321,998,810 versus 396,050,000 on Friday.</p>
